{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_20902","headline":"老夫采玉歌 · 李贺","name":"老夫采玉歌","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"采玉采玉须水碧，琢作步摇徒好色。\n老夫饥寒龙爲愁，蓝溪水气无清白。\n夜雨冈头食蓁子，杜鹃口血老夫泪。\n蓝溪之水厌生人，身死千年恨溪水。\n斜山柏风雨如啸，泉脚挂绳青褭褭。\n村寒白屋念娇婴，古台石磴悬肠草。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"李贺","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_20902.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_20902","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"乐府","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}